                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Among the subjects discussed by the Foreign Ministers at their meetings in
                    London, May 11–13, was the Austrian Treaty. Working from the tripartite report
                    prepared by the Deputies for Austria, the Ministers agreed on the text of a
                    declaration for Austria which was released to the press on May 19. For the text
                    of the declaration and for further documentation on the Foreign Ministers
                    discussion of Austria, see <ref target="frus:frus1950v03/pg_1071">volume III,
                        pages 1071</ref> and <ref target="frus:frus1950v03/pg_828">828</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
